public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
    int keyCode = System.in.read();
    System.out.println("KeyCode : " + keyCode);
}
```

```java
public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        while(true) {
            int keyCode = System.in.read();
            System.out.println("KeyCode : " + keyCode);
            if (keyCode == 'q') break;
        }
    }
